  ―<I>have your chance,</I>㉗I stop myself from finishing. The boy says nothing, but I see a flicker of pain at the corners of his eyes.

  He knows. The soccer field is not a place for Ashikaga Kuniuji. Talent or no, he can never hope to share in the sweat and the glory.

  Not even if it is his dream.

